  (a) Manipulation checks; the memory check saturates at 1.000 with zero
  variance (diamond). (b) Downstream rate contrasts; gray marks the two
  contrasts whose intervals cross zero. (c) The downstream count contrast
  (closed-route rejections per household) on its own scale.}
  \label{fig:e2-effects}
\end{figure*}

